{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "力", "id": "力"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "尊", "id": "尊"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "速", "id": "速"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "悅", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 0.0769610411361284, "source": "悅", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "悅", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 0.4134332777573413, "source": "心", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.23111172096338664, "source": "心", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.9242589015233319, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.3297240096314962, "source": "心", "target": "力"}, {"weight": 1.6174060820832772, "source": "心", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 0.23111172096338664, "source": "心", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "天", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "天", "target": "尊"}, {"weight": 1.552867560945706, "source": "取", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.7568403652716422, "source": "取", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.290503296478215, "source": "知", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.290503296478215, "source": "知", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.8850381883700505, "source": "知", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.57818